{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqgr5galbxq","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Standing drains (judge / label / learner) dispatch via headless `claude -p`, not in-session Agent subagents","summary":"Decision (2026-06-16, user-owned migration): all recurring drain workers — edge-judge drain, label drain, learner drain — move to headless `claude -p` invocations instead of in-session background Agent-tool subagents dispatched from the interactive/dispatcher session. Rationale: decouples high-volume mechanical drain work from the interactive session's per-turn context budget and makes drains independently schedulable (cron / daemon-spawned). Consequence: the dispatcher session should NOT spin up the old in-session Agent drain on the heartbeat nudge once this lands. The note-decay feature (task #1) is queued to run after this.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-16T14:43:33.693Z","vec":[-0.05475031957030296,0.027376562356948853,-0.04330715537071228,0.016791410744190216,-0.010508447885513306,-0.026847951114177704,0.020946485921740532,0.0030301669612526894,0.02000391110777855,0.021523112431168556,-0.03812435641884804,0.0011098665418103337,-0.05934183672070503,0.003019739640876651,-0.01286468468606472,0.025628451257944107,0.12797412276268005,-0.07257068902254105,0.01672818697988987,-0.02116670459508896,-0.0170288123190403,-0.040154024958610535,0.044962070882320404,0.021848395466804504,-0.052776239812374115,-0.006405770778656006,-0.09632168710231781,-0.07704904675483704,0.0729362741112709,-0.0303104929625988,0.03755867853760719,0.05520790442824364,-0.056716423481702805,-0.09175663441419601,0.08098197728395462,0.1112203374505043,0.012501929886639118,0.017966488376259804,0.010317517444491386,0.01237360667437315,0.10420096665620804,-0.003680725581943989,-0.03639053925871849,-0.0011769782286137342,-0.04420565441250801,0.0069373310543596745,-0.046878382563591,-0.0875324010848999,-0.03586376830935478,-0.012986340560019016,0.030812149867415428,-0.020148271694779396,0.083619